hat to change: shapes, dtype (e.g. bfloat16), eps, multi-case JSON, etc.\",\"label\":\"Modify\"}],\"question\":\"The RMSNorm task file (rmsnorm.py) is validated. Accept it and proceed to sketch design + code generation? Note: this machine has no torch_npu/CANN/NPU, so runtime verification (verify.py/benchmark.py) can only run after code is moved to an Ascend environment — I can still do AST checks and CPU-side reference validation.\"}]}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9d10416509bfa397","content":"User has answered your questions: . You can now continue with the user's answers in mind."},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-868ab9bd4d262c11","type":"function","function":{"name":"TaskUpdate","arguments":"{\"status\":\"completed\",\"taskId\":\"1\"}"}},{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9b3c4457fe0a79d6","type":"function","function":{"name":"TaskUpdate","arguments":"{\"status\":\"in_progress\",\"taskId\":\"2\"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-868ab9bd4d262c11","content":"Updated task #1 status"},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9b3c4457fe0a79d6","content":"Updated task #2 status"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Task accepted. Loading the required references for sketch design (UnifiedSketch DSL spec, NPU hardware guide, and the most relevant reduction cases — RMSNorm is a row-reduce + fused elementwise op).","tool_calls":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-abd14465695667cc","type":"function","function":{"name":"Bash","arguments":"{\"command\":\"ls /home/vince/.claude/plugins/cache/ascend-agent-skills/cannbot-triton-op-generator-skills/1.0.0/triton-op-designer/references/ /home/vince/.claude/plugins/cache/ascend-agent-skills/cannbot-triton-op-generator-skills/1.0.0/triton-op-designer/references/cases/ 2>/dev/null; ls /home/vince/.claude/plugins/cache/ascend-agent-skills/cannbot-triton-op-generator-skills/1.0.0/npu-arch/references/\",\"description\":\"List designer references and npu-arch files\"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-abd14465695667cc","content":"[exit code: 0]\n/home/vince/.claude/plugins/cache/ascend-agent-skills/cannbot-triton-op-generator-skills/1.0.0/triton-op-designer/references/:\ncases\nhint-mode.md\nsketch-design-extended.md\nsketch-design.md\n\n/home/vince/.claude/plugins/cache/ascend-agent-skills/cannbot-triton-op-generator-skills/1.0.0/triton-op-designer/references/cases/:\nelemwise-broadcast-2d.md\nelemwise-broadcast-3d.md\nelemwise-cast.md\nelemwise-concat.md\nelemwise-zeros.md\nindex-histogram.md\nindex-put.md\nmatmul-swizzle2d.md\nreduction-amax-large.md\nreduction-amax-medium.md\nreduction-amax-small.md\nreduction-amin-atomic.md\nreduction-amin-large.md\nreduction-amin-medium.md\nreduction-amin-small.md\nreduction-mean-large.md\nreduction-mean-medium.md\nreduction-prod-small.md\nreduction-sum-fused.md\nreduction-sum-large.md\nreduction-weighted-swiglu.md\nnpu-arch-guide-triton.md\nnpu-arch-guide.md\nnpu-hardware-params.md\nsimt-arch-guide.md\n"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8c5bbbcde4d8bb08","type":"function","function":{"name":"Read","arguments":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/vince/.claude/plugins/cache/ascend-agent-skills/cannbot-triton-op-generator-skills/1.0.0/triton-op-designer/references/sketch-design.md\"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8c5bbbcde4d8bb08","content":"1\t# UnifiedSketch 设计规范\n2\t\n3\t## 目标与原则\n4\t\n5\t### 目标\n6\t用最小 DSL 表达算子设计意图，便于 LLM 理解和 triton-op-coding 实现。\n7\t\n8\t### 原则\n9\t- **极简原语**：只有少数核心操作（alloc/load/store/compute/...）\n10\t- **统一语法**：所有操作都是函数调用风格，无语法差异\n11\t- **标准控制流**：使用 Python for/range 语法\n12\t- **hint 分离**：复杂优化用 hint 表达，不影响主逻辑清晰性\n13\t\n14\t## 核心语法元素\n15\t\n16\t### 结构声明\n17\t\n18\t```python\n19\tsketch <op_name> {\n20\t  symbols: M, N, K;                    # 符号变量声明\n21\t  tensors: A[M, K]: f16; B[K, N]: f16; C[M, N]: f32;  # 张量声明\n22\t  constexpr: m0, k0, n0\n23\t}\n24\t```\n25\t\n26\t### @llm_hint 装饰器\n27\t\n28\t`@llm_hint` 给 LLM 提供优化提示，帮助 triton-op-coding 选择最优实现策略。\n29\t\n30\t```python\n31\t@llm_hint(\"optimization_type\")              # 单一提示\n32\t@llm_hint(\"optimization_type\", \"context\")   # 带上下文的提示\n33\t@llm_hint(\"opt1\", \"opt2\", \"opt3\")          # 多重提示\n34\t```\n35\t\n36\t#### 优化类型\n37\t- `\"parallel\"` — 并行化此循环\n38\t- `\"pipeline\"` — 流水线优化\n39\t- `\"vectorize\"` — 向量化\n40\t- `\"unroll\"` — 循环展开\n41\t\n42\t#### Ascend NPU 硬件上下文提示\n43\t- `\"coreidx\"` — NPU AI Core 级别并行\n44\t- `\"simd\"` — NPU SIMD 向量化\n45\t\n46\t### for 循环表达\n47\t\n48\t```python\n49\t# NPU 风格：core 级别并行\n50\t@llm_hint(\"parallel\", \"coreidx\")\n51\tfor core_idx in range(num_cores):\n52\t    @llm_hint(\"pipeline\")\n53\t    for k in range(0, K, k_tile):\n54\t        # 每个 core 的计算\n55\t\n56\t# 数据切分风格\n57\t@llm_hint(\"parallel\")\n58\tfor i in range(0, M, tile_size):\n59\t    @llm_hint(\"vectorize\")\n60\t    for j in range(tile_size):\n61\t        # 向量化计算\n62\t```\n63\t\n64\t### 核心操作\n65\t1. **alloc** — 内存分配\n66\t2. **load** — 数据加载\n67\t3. **store** — 数据存储\n68\t4. **compute 函数** — 计算操作\n69\t\n70\t## 语法概览\n71\t\n72\t```python\n73\tsketch matmul {\n74\t  symbols: M, N, K;\n75\t  tensors: A[M, K]: f16; B[K, N]: f16; C[M, N]: f32;\n76\t\n77\t  m0, k0, n0 = 128, 256, 256\n78\t\n79\t  @llm_hint(\"parallel\")\n80\t  for i_outer in range(0, ceil(M, m0)):\n81\t    @llm_hint(\"parallel\")\n82\t    for j_outer in range(0, ceil(N, n0)):\n83\t\n84\t      # 内存分配\n85\t      c_tile = alloc([m0, n0], llm_hint=[\"accumulator\", \"init_zero\"])\n86\t      a_tile = alloc([m0, k0], llm_hint=[\"fast\", \"input_cache\"])\n87\t      b_tile = alloc([k0, n0], llm_hint=[\"fast\", \"input_cache\"])\n88\t\n89\t      @llm_hint(\"pipeline\")\n90\t      for k_outer in range(0, ceil(K, k0)):\n91\t        # 数据搬移\n92\t        load(A[i_outer:i_outer+m0, k_outer:k_outer+k0] -> a_tile)\n93\t        load(B[k_outer:k_outer+k0, j_outer:j_outer+n0] -> b_tile)\n94\t\n95\t        # 计算操作\n96\t        gemm(a_tile, b_tile, dst=c_tile)\n97\t\n98\t      # 数据写回\n99\t      store(c_tile -> C[i_outer:i_outer+m0, j_outer:j_outer+n0])\n100\t}\n101\t```\n102\t\n103\t## 内存管理系统\n104\t\n105\t### alloc() 语法\n106\t\n107\t```python\n108\ttile = alloc([shape], llm_hint=[\"存储要求\", \"用途说明\", \"性能要求\"])\n109\t```\n110\t\n111\t### hint 设计原则\n112\t\n113\t**语义化描述，由 triton-op-coding 根据硬件文档选择具体实现。**\n114\t\n115\t#### 存储要求（性能层次）\n116\t\n117\t| hint | 含义 | Ascend NPU 映射 |\n118\t|------|------|-----------------|\n119\t| `\"fastest\"` | 最快访问速度，容量小 | L0（L0A/L0B/L0C） |\n120\t| `\"fast\"` | 快速访问，中等容量 | L1 Buffer / UB |\n121\t| `\"medium\"` | 中等速度，较大容量 | L2 Cache |\n122\t| `\"slow\"` | 较慢但容量大 | Global Memory (HBM) |\n123\t\n124\t#### 用途说明\n125\t- `\"accumulator\"` — 累加器，需要频繁读写\n126\t- `\"input_cache\"` — 输入数据缓存，主要读取\n127\t- `\"output_buffer\"` — 输出缓冲，主要写入\n128\t- `\"temp_workspace\"` — 临时工作空间\n129\t\n130\t#### 初始化要求\n131\t- `\"init_zero\"` — 初始化为 0\n132\t- `\"no_init\"` — 不初始化（默认）\n133\t\n134\t### 示例\n135\t\n136\t```python\n137\t# 语义化 hint 方式（推荐）\n138\tc_acc = alloc([128, 128], llm_hint=[\"fastest\", \"accumulator\", \"init_zero\"])\n139\ta_cache = alloc([128, 256], llm_hint=[\"fast\", \"input_cache\"])\n140\ttemp = alloc([128], llm_hint=[\"fast\", \"temp_workspace\"])\n141\t\n142\t# triton-op-coding 会根据 Ascend NPU 硬件文档将其映射为：\n143\t# fastest → L0C（Cube 累加器）\n144\t# fast → L1 Buffer / UB（Unified Buffer）\n145\t```\n146\t\n147\t## 数据搬移操作\n148\t\n149\t### load() 语法\n150\t```python\n151\tload(tensor[slice] -> tile)\n152\t```\n153\t\n154\t### store() 语法\n155\t```python\n156\tstore(tile -> tensor[slice])\n157\t```\n158\t\n159\t### 切片表达\n160\t```python\n161\tA[i:i+128, k:k+256]           # 二维切片\n162\tX[start:end]                   # 一维切片\n163\tA[i_outer:i_outer+m0, k_outer:k_outer+k0]  # 参数化切片\n164\t```\n165\t\n166\t## 计算操作库\n167\t\n168\t### 基础运算\n169\t```python\n170\tadd(src1, src2, dst)          # dst = src1 + src2\n171\tmul(src1, src2, dst)          # dst = src1 * src2\n172\tsub(src1, src2, dst)          # dst = src1 - src2\n173\tdiv(src1, src2, dst)          # dst = src1 / src2\n174\tmax(src1, src2, dst)          # dst = max(src1, src2)\n175\tmin(src1, src2, dst)          # dst = min(src1, src2)\n176\t```\n177\t\n178\t### 数学函数\n179\t```python\n180\texp(src, dst)                 # dst = exp(src)\n181\tlog(src, dst)                 # dst = log(src)\n182\tsqrt(src, dst)                # dst = sqrt(src)\n183\tabs(src, dst)                 # dst = abs(src)\n184\ttanh(src, dst)                # dst = tanh(src)\n185\tsigmoid(src, dst)             # dst = sigmoid(src)\n186\t```\n187\t\n188\t### 线性代数\n189\t```python\n190\tgemm(a, b, dst)               # dst += a @ b (矩阵乘法)\n191\tdot(a, b, result)             # result = dot(a, b) (向量点积)\n192\treduce_sum(src, axis, dst)    # dst = sum(src, axis=axis)，axis 可为 list（多轴同时 reduce）\n193\treduce_max(src, axis, dst)    # dst = max(src, axis=axis)\n194\t```\n195\t\n196\t### 复合函数\n197\t```python\n198\trelu(src, dst)                # dst = max(0, src)\n199\tgelu(src, dst)                # dst = gelu(src)\n200\tsilu(src, dst)                # dst = src * sigmoid(src)\n201\tsoftmax(src, dst)             # dst = softmax(src)\n202\t```\n203\t\n204\t## 并行与优化提示\n205\t\n206\t### Ascend NPU 并行模式\n207\t\n208\t```python\n209\t# Core 级别并行（AI Core 间分配任务）\n210\t@llm_hint(\"parallel\", \"coreidx\")\n211\tfor core_idx in range(num_cores):\n212\t    @llm_hint(\"pipeline\")\n213\t    for k in range(k_tiles):\n214\t        @llm_hint(\"vectorize\")\n215\t        for i in range(vector_size):\n216\t            # 向量计算\n217\t```\n218\t\n219\t## 常见模式示例\n220\t\n221\t### MatMul\n222\t\n223\t见上方语法概览。\n224\t\n225\t### Elementwise — ReLU\n226\t\n227\t```python\n228\tsketch relu {\n229\t  symbols: N;\n230\t  tensors: X[N]: f32; Y[N]: f32;\n231\t\n232\t  tile_size = 1024\n233\t\n234\t  @llm_hint(\"parallel\")\n235\t  for i in range(0, ceil(N, tile_size)):\n236\t    x_tile = alloc([tile_size], llm_hint=[\"fast\", \"input_cache\"])\n237\t    y_tile = alloc([tile_size], llm_hint=[\"fast\", \"output_buffer\"])\n238\t\n239\t    load(X[i:i+tile_size] -> x_tile)\n240\t    relu(x_tile, y_tile)\n241\t    store(y_tile -> Y[i:i+tile_size])\n242\t}\n243\t```\n244\t\n245\t### Reduction — Softmax\n246\t\n247\t```python\n248\tsketch softmax {\n249\t  symbols: B, N;\n250\t  tensors: X[B, N]: f32; Y[B, N]: f32;\n251\t\n252\t  @llm_hint(\"parallel\")\n253\t  for b in range(B):\n254\t    x_row = alloc([N], llm_hint=[\"fast\", \"input_cache\"])\n255\t    y_row = alloc([N], llm_hint=[\"fast\", \"output_buffer\"])\n256\t    max_val = alloc([1], llm_hint=[\"fastest\", \"accumulator\"])\n257\t    sum_val = alloc([1], llm_hint=[\"fastest\", \"accumulator\"])\n258\t\n259\t    load(X[b, 0:N] -> x_row)\n260\t\n261\t    # 三阶段 softmax\n262\t    reduce_max(x_row, axis=0, max_val)\n263\t    sub(x_row, max_val, x_row)        # x = x - max\n264\t    exp(x_row, y_row)                 # y = exp(x)\n265\t    reduce_sum(y_row, axis=0, sum_val)\n266\t    div(y_row, sum_val, y_row)        # y = y / sum\n267\t\n268\t    store(y_row -> Y[b, 0:N])\n269\t}\n270\t```\n271\t\n272\t### 复合算子 — GELU\n273\t\n274\t```python\n275\tsketch gelu {\n276\t  symbols: N;\n277\t  tensors: X[N]: f32; Y[N]: f32;\n278\t\n279\t  tile_size = 512\n280\t\n281\t  @llm_hint(\"parallel\")\n282\t  for i in range(0, ceil(N, tile_size)):\n283\t    x_tile = alloc([tile_size], llm_hint=[\"fast\", \"input_cache\"])\n284\t    y_tile = alloc([tile_size], llm_hint=[\"fast\", \"output_buffer\"])\n285\t\n286\t    load(X[i:i+tile_size] -> x_tile)\n287\t    gelu(x_tile, y_tile)\n288\t    store(y_tile -> Y[i:i+tile_size])\n289\t}\n290\t```\n291\t\n292\t## 最佳实践\n293\t\n294\t### 编写顺序\n295\t1. **先写基本结构**：symbols, tensors, 主循环框架\n296\t2. **再加内存管理**：alloc 合适的 tile\n297\t3. **然后加数据流**：load → compute → store\n298\t4. **最后加优化 hint**：@llm_hint 装饰器\n299\t\n300\t### Tile 大小设置\n301\t- 考虑 Ascend NPU UB 容量（参考硬件规格文件）\n302\t- 优先选择 2 的幂次（128, 256, 512, 1024）\n303\t- 保证 256B / 512B 数据对齐要求\n304\t\n305\t### 错误避免\n306\t- **不要混用抽象层次**：要么用高级函数（gelu），要么用基础运算（add+mul）\n307\t- **明确数据流向**：每个 load 都要有对应的 compute，每个 compute 都要有对应的 store\n308\t- **合理使用 hint**：不要过度优化，先保证逻辑正确\n309\t\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b63cf43fbe1c649c","type":"function","function":{"name":"Read","arguments":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/vince/.claude/plugins/cache/ascend-agent-skills/cannbot-triton-op-generator-skills/1.0.0/npu-arch/references/npu-arch-guide-triton.md\",\"limit\":120}"}},{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9f1d4e9dc55f89a3","type":"function","function":{"name":"Read","arguments":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/vince/.claude/plugins/cache/ascend-agent-skills/cannbot-triton-op-generator-skills/1.0.0/triton-op-designer/references/cases/reduction-sum-fused.md\"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b63cf43fbe1c649c","content":"1\t# NPU 架构代际说明\n2\t\n3\t本文档说明 Ascend NPU 的架构代际划分及其对算子开发的影响。\n4\t\n5\t---\n6\t\n7\t## 目录\n8\t\n9\t1. [架构代际概述](#架构代际概述)\n10\t2. [完整映射表](#完整映射表)\n11\t3. [典型硬件参数与获取方式](#典型硬件参数与获取方式)\n12\t4. [DAV_3510 微架构与编程影响](#dav_3510-微架构与编程影响)\n13\t5. [SIMT vs SIMD 硬件能力差异](#simt-vs-simd-硬件能力差异)\n14\t6. [DAV_3510 数据格式扩展](#dav_3510-数据格式扩展)\n15\t7. [CCU 通算融合开发模型](#ccu-通算融合开发模型)\n16\t8. [架构兼容性检查清单](#架构兼容性检查清单)\n17\t9. [参考信息来源](#参考信息来源)\n18\t\n19\t---\n20\t\n21\t## 架构代际概述\n22\t\n23\t### 核心概念\n24\t\n25\t| 概念 | 说明 |\n26\t|-----|------|\n27\t| **__NPU_ARCH__** | Device 侧编译宏，四位数值，用于条件编译 |\n28\t| **archXX** | 算子仓架构目录简写，取 DAV 编号前两位，如 arch22、arch35 |\n29\t\n30\t### 架构目录简写（archXX）\n31\t\n32\t| 目录 | 对应 NpuArch | 芯片 |\n33\t|------|-------------|------|\n34\t| **arch22** | DAV_2201 | Ascend910B 系列、Ascend910_93 |\n35\t| **arch35** | DAV_3510 | Ascend950DT / Ascend950PR |\n36\t\n37\t> 命名规则：`archXX` = `arch` + DAV 编号前两位。如 DAV_**22**01 → arch22，DAV_**35**10 → arch35。\n38\t\n39\t### 架构代号别名\n40\t\n41\t| 代号 | 对应 SocVersion | 对应 NpuArch | 说明 |\n42\t|-----|----------------|-------------|------|\n43\t| **A2** | ASCEND910B | DAV_2201 | Ascend910B1~B4, Ascend910B2C |\n44\t| **A3** | ASCEND910B (含 Ascend910_93) | DAV_2201 | 训练/推理芯片 |\n45\t| **A5** | ASCEND950 | DAV_3510 | Ascend950DT (Decode) / Ascend950PR (Prefill) |\n46\t\n47\t**核心关系：一对多**\n48\t\n49\t一个 NpuArch 可以对应多个 SocVersion。例如 `DAV_2201` 对应 Ascend910B1~B4、Ascend910B2C、Ascend910_93。\n50\t\n51\t> **注意**：对 NPU 核内算子开发来说，通常不需要感知具体 SocVersion，使用 NpuArch 来区分芯片有利于易用性和可维护性。\n52\t\n53\t### 关键细节\n54\t\n55\t- `Ascend910_93` 的运行时映射关系详见 [`npu-hardware-params.md` §0](npu-hardware-params.md#0-产品映射表)\n56\t\n57\t---\n58\t\n59\t## 完整映射表\n60\t\n61\t完整产品系列 / SocVersion / NpuArch / 芯片型号映射见 [`npu-hardware-params.md` §0 产品映射表](npu-hardware-params.md#0-产品映射表)。\n62\t\n63\t---\n64\t\n65\t## 典型硬件参数与获取方式\n66\t\n67\t> ⚠️ **核心原则**：本节作为 NPU 架构知识在 skills 仓中的上游真源，下游 skill 应消费本节数据，**反向自引用即视为风险**。\n68\t>\n69\t> 表内为**规格典型值**（族系规格），具体 SKU 可能裁剪（如 Ascend910B3 / Ascend910B4 均为 20 核），vNPU 切分后单实例可见值更低。**算子运行时必须通过下方接口获取实际值**，硬编码典型值会越界或浪费。\n70\t>\n71\t> 完整参数参考（架构常量/典型SKU/基于公开资料与经验值）见 `npu-hardware-params.md`。\n72\t\n73\t### 算力与系统规格\n74\t\n75\t| 规格项 | Ascend910B2 (DAV_2201) | Ascend950PR PCIE (DAV_3510) | Ascend950PR Server (DAV_3510) |\n76\t|--------|:---:|:---:|:---:|\n77\t| CubeCore 核数 | **24** | **28** | **32** |\n78\t| 频率 (GHz) | 1.8 | 1.65 | 1.65 |\n79\t| Cube 算力 BF16/FP16 | 353T | 378T | 432T |\n80\t| Cube 算力 FP8/HiF8/MXFP8 | — | 757T | 865T |\n81\t| Cube 算力 MXFP4 | — | 1514T | 1730T |\n82\t| Vector 算力 FP16 | 22T | 47T [¹](#unverified) | 54T [¹](#unverified) |\n83\t| Memory 容量 (GB) | 64 | 112 | 128 |\n84\t| Memory 带宽 | 1.6 TB/s [¹](#unverified) | 1.4 TB/s [¹](#unverified) | 1.6 TB/s [¹](#unverified) |\n85\t\n86\t> **注意**：以上为选定子型号的典型值（真源：`platform_config/*.ini`）。**同架构其他子型号的核数、频率、L2、Memory 等存在差异**（如 910B4 核数 20@1.5GHz / L2 96MB / Memory 32GB），详见 `npu-hardware-params.md` 典型SKU示例。\n87\t\n88\t#### Cube 算力公式推导\n89\t\n90\tCube BF16/FP16 理论峰值算力（TFLOPS）由以下公式计算：\n91\t\n92\t```\n93\tTFLOPS = M × K × N × 核数 × cube_freq(MHz) × 2 ÷ 10⁶\n94\t```\n95\t\n96\t**参数含义**：\n97\t\n98\t| 参数 | 值 | 来源 |\n99\t|------|:--:|------|\n100\t| M × K × N (Cube MAC 阵列) | 16×16×16 = **4096** | INI `cube_m_size=cube_k_size=cube_n_size=16` |\n101\t| AICore 核数 | 24(910B2) / 28(PCIE) / 32(Server) | INI `[SoCInfo] ai_core_cnt` |\n102\t| cube_freq | 1800(910B2) / 1650(950PR) MHz | INI `[AICoreSpec] cube_freq` |\n103\t| ×2 | FMA 计为 2 次浮点运算 | 1 次 MAC = 1 乘 + 1 加 |\n104\t| ÷10⁶ | MAC/s → TFLOPS | TFLOPS = 10¹² FLOPS = 10⁶ × 10⁶ MAC×2 |\n105\t\n106\t**推导示例**：\n107\t\n108\t```\n109\t950PR Server:  4096 × 32 × 1650 × 2 ÷ 10⁶ = 432.54 TFLOPS\n110\t950PR PCIE:    4096 × 28 × 1650 × 2 ÷ 10⁶ = 378.47 TFLOPS\n111\tAscend910B2:   4096 × 24 × 1800 × 2 ÷ 10⁶ = 353.89 TFLOPS\n112\t```\n113\t\n114\t> **Cube 算力与 Vector 算力**：上表中 Cube 算力为纯 Cube 单元算力，不含 Vector Core 贡献。Vector 算力单独列出，总芯片算力 = Cube + Vector（但需注意 Vector 不支持 bfloat16，故 BF16 总算力即 Cube 算力）。\n115\t\n116\t#### FP8_E4M3FN 算力推导\n117\t\n118\t不同于 FP16/BF16 使用 `cube_m/n/k_size=16×16×16=4096`，FP8_E4M3FN 的 Cube MAC 阵列更大（INI `[DtypeMKN]` 段）：\n119\t\n120\t```\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9f1d4e9dc55f89a3","content":"1\t---\n2\tname: triton-ascend-case-reduction-sum-fused\n3\tdescription: \"Reduction+Elementwise融合算子优化：先逐元素操作再归约，行二次切分+计算重组，grid=40且SUB切分不含尾块时性能最优（47.58us），融合优化逻辑以reduce为主，适用于需要先逐元素计算再reduce的融合场景\"\n4\tcategory: example\n5\tversion: \"1.0.0\"\n6\tmetadata:\n7\t  backend: ascend\n8\t  dsl: triton-ascend\n9\t  hardware: \"Atlas A2, Atlas A3\"\n10\t---\n11\t\n12\t# Reduction + Elementwise 融合算子优化\n13\t\n14\t## 任务特征\n15\t- **数据尺寸**：(1000, 8192), (8192,)，融合算子\n16\t- **特点**：先进行向量化逐元素操作，再沿列方向求和归约\n17\t\n18\t## 优化 1：行二次切分\n19\t\n20\t```python\n21\tpid = tl.program_id(0)\n22\tfor m_start in range(0, BLOCK_SIZE_M, SUB_BLOCK_SIZE_M):\n23\t    m_offsets = pid * BLOCK_SIZE_M + m_start + tl.arange(0, SUB_BLOCK_SIZE_M)\n24\t```\n25\t\n26\t## 优化 2：计算重组\n27\t\n28\t```python\n29\t# 错误：简单\n30\ttotal_sum = 0.0\n31\tfor n_offset in range(0, N, BLOCK_SIZE):\n32\t    total_sum += tl.sum(tl.where(mask, t3, 0.0))\n33\t\n34\t# 正确：优化\n35\tacc = tl.zeros([SUB_BLOCK_SIZE_M, BLOCK_SIZE_N], dtype=tl.float32)\n36\tfor n_start in range(0, N, BLOCK_SIZE_N):\n37\t    acc += tl.where(mask, t3, 0.0)\n38\ttotal_sum = tl.sum(acc, axis=1)\n39\t```\n40\t\n41\t## Autotune 配置\n42\t\n43\t```python\n44\t# （AI core=40）\n45\t# 1. grid=20<40 -> 91.69 us\n46\ttriton.Config({'BLOCK_SIZE_M': 50, 'SUB_BLOCK_SIZE_M': 25, 'BLOCK_SIZE_N': 256})\n47\t\n48\t# 2. grid=40，SUB切分含尾块 -> 53.30 us\n49\ttriton.Config({'BLOCK_SIZE_M': 25, 'SUB_BLOCK_SIZE_M': 4, 'BLOCK_SIZE_N': 2048})\n50\t\n51\t# 3. grid=40，SUB切分不含尾块 -> 47.58 us 最优\n52\ttriton.Config({'BLOCK_SIZE_M': 25, 'SUB_BLOCK_SIZE_M': 25, 'BLOCK_SIZE_N': 256})\n53\t\n54\t# 4. grid>40，且非核数整数倍 -> 79.00 us\n55\ttriton.Config({'BLOCK_SIZE_M': 20, 'SUB_BLOCK_SIZE_M': 20, 'BLOCK_SIZE_N': 256})\n56\t```\n57\t\n58\t### 总结\n59\t融合算子优化逻辑以reduce为主。grid等于核数、SUB切分不含尾块时性能最优。\n60\t\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b1dd7177cd9b543d","type":"function","function":{"name":"Read","arguments":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/vince/.claude/plugins/cache/ascend-agent-skills/cannbot-triton-op-generator-skills/1.0.0/triton-op-designer/references/cases/reduction-mean-large.md\"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b1dd7177cd9b543d","content":"1\t---\n2\tname: triton-ascend-case-reduction-mean-large\n3\tdescription: \"大规模reduce最后根轴（mean）行二次切分优化：每个kernel计算多行减少线程块数量、kernel内二次切分避免超UB，grid=40且SUB切分不含尾块时性能最优（16.00us），尾块计算会显著降低性能，适用于非reduce轴中等、reduce轴较大的2D归约场景\"\n4\tcategory: example\n5\tversion: \"1.0.0\"\n6\tmetadata:\n7\t  backend: ascend\n8\t  dsl: triton-ascend\n9\t  hardware: \"Atlas A2, Atlas A3\"\n10\t---\n11\t\n12\t# 大规模 Mean 归约优化（行二次切分）\n13\t\n14\t## 任务特征\n15\t- **数据尺寸**：(1000, 8192)，非reduce轴中等，reduce轴较大\n16\t\n17\t## 优化：行二次切分\n18\t\n19\t```python\n20\tpid = tl.program_id(0)\n21\tfor m_start in range(0, BLOCK_SIZE_M, SUB_BLOCK_SIZE_M):\n22\t    m_offsets = pid * BLOCK_SIZE_M + m_start + tl.arange(0, SUB_BLOCK_SIZE_M)\n23\t```\n24\t\n25\t**目的**：\n26\t- 每个kernel计算多行（BLOCK_SIZE_M），减少总线程块数量\n27\t- Kernel内对行进行二次切分（SUB_BLOCK_SIZE_M），避免超出硬件缓存\n28\t\n29\t## Autotune 配置\n30\t\n31\t```python\n32\t# （AI core=40）\n33\t# 1. grid<40 -> 28.64 us\n34\ttriton.Config({'BLOCK_SIZE_M': 50, 'SUB_BLOCK_SIZE_M': 25, 'BLOCK_SIZE_N': 512})\n35\t\n36\t# 2. grid=40，SUB切分含尾块 -> 16.54 us\n37\ttriton.Config({'BLOCK_SIZE_M': 25, 'SUB_BLOCK_SIZE_M': 4, 'BLOCK_SIZE_N': 4096})\n38\t\n39\t# 3. grid=40，SUB切分不含尾块 -> 16.00 us 最优\n40\ttriton.Config({'BLOCK_SIZE_M': 25, 'SUB_BLOCK_SIZE_M': 25, 'BLOCK_SIZE_N': 512})\n41\t\n42\t# 4. grid>40，且非核数整数倍 -> 25.86 us\n43\ttriton.Config({'BLOCK_SIZE_M': 20, 'SUB_BLOCK_SIZE_M': 20, 'BLOCK_SIZE_N': 512})\n44\t```\n45\t\n46\t### 总结\n47\t1. grid等于核数，SUB切分不含尾块时性能最优\n48\t2. 尾块计算会降低性能\n49\t3. grid超出核数且非核数整数倍时，各核计算任务不均匀，性能较差\n50\t\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b7de06497c8a2f84","type":"function","function":{"name":"Read","arguments":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/vince/.claude/plugins/cache/ascend-agent-skills/cannbot-triton-op-generator-skills/1.0.0/triton-op-designer/references/cases/reduction-mean-medium.md\"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b7de06497c8a2f84","content":"1\t---\n2\tname: triton-ascend-case-reduction-mean-medium\n3\tdescription: \"中等规模reduce第一根轴（mean）优化：计算重组减少归约次数，网格规模略小于AI Core数量且避免尾块时性能最佳（grid=32最优9.98us），适用于reduce第一根轴、两轴均中等（百万级元素）的2D归约场景\"\n4\tcategory: example\n5\tversion: \"1.0.0\"\n6\tmetadata:\n7\t  backend: ascend\n8\t  dsl: triton-ascend\n9\t  hardware: \"Atlas A2, Atlas A3\"\n10\t---\n11\t\n12\t# 中等规模 Mean 归约优化（reduce第一根轴）\n13\t\n14\t## 任务特征\n15\t- **数据尺寸**：(1024, 4096)，reduce第一根轴，非reduce轴中等\n16\t\n17\t## 优化：计算重组\n18\t\n19\t```python\n20\t# 简单\n21\ttotal_sum = 0.0\n22\tfor n_offset in range(0, N, BLOCK_SIZE):\n23\t  错误：row_sum += tl.sum(block_vals)\n24\t\n25\t# 正确：优化\n26\tcol_sum = tl.zeros((BLOCK_SIZE_M, BLOCK_SIZE_N), dtype=tl.float32)\n27\tfor m_start in range(0, M, BLOCK_SIZE_M):\n28\t    col_sum += block_vals\n29\tcol_sum = tl.sum(col_sum, axis=0)\n30\t```\n31\t\n32\t## Autotune 配置\n33\t\n34\t```python\n35\t# （AI core=40）\n36\t# 1. grid=16<40, UB占满 -> 13.32 us\n37\ttriton.Config({'BLOCK_SIZE_M': 64, 'BLOCK_SIZE_N': 256})\n38\t\n39\t# 2. grid=40，有尾块 -> 35.12 us\n40\ttriton.Config({'BLOCK_SIZE_M': 128, 'BLOCK_SIZE_N': 103})\n41\t\n42\t# 3. grid=32<40，UB占满 -> 9.98 us 最优\n43\ttriton.Config({'BLOCK_SIZE_M': 128, 'BLOCK_SIZE_N': 128})\n44\t\n45\t# 4. grid=64>40，UB占满 -> 13.33 us\n46\ttriton.Config({'BLOCK_SIZE_M': 256, 'BLOCK_SIZE_N': 64})\n47\t\n48\t# 5. grid=128>40，UB占满 -> 22.22 us\n49\ttriton.Config({'BLOCK_SIZE_M': 512, 'BLOCK_SIZE_N': 32})\n50\t```\n51\t\n52\t### 总结\n53\t网格规模略小于AI Core数量且避免尾块时性能最佳。尾块导致性能大幅下降。\n54\t\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"},{"role":"assistant","content":"References loaded. Key takeaways for RMSNorm (reduce-last-axis, M=4096 rows × N=1024, fp16): whole reduce axis fits in UB (N=1024, 2KB fp16 / 4KB fp32 per row), so design = one program handles a row-block, fp32 accumulation, avoid tail blocks, grid ≈ AI core count. Writing the sketch.\n\n**Algorithm sketch** (UnifiedSketch DSL):\n\n```python\nsketch rmsnorm {\n  symbols: M, N;                          # M = B*S flattened rows (4096), N = hidden (1024)\n  tensors: X[M, N]: f16; W[N]: f16; Y[M, N]: f16;\n\n  eps = 1e-6\n  BLOCK_N = 1024                          # N fits in one tile (2KB f16 / 4KB f32 in UB)\n  ROWS_PER_PROG = 64                      # grid = M / 64 = 64 programs ≈ AI core count scale\n  SUB_M = 16                              # secondary row split, no tail block (64 % 16 == 0)\n\n  @llm_hint(\"parallel\", \"coreidx\")\n  for pid in range(ceil(M, ROWS_PER_PROG)):\n    @llm_hint(\"vectorize\")\n    for m_start in range(0, ROWS_PER_PROG, SUB_M):     # row secondary split, no tail\n      rows = pid * ROWS_PER_PROG + m_start + arange(SUB_M)\n      cols = arange(BLOCK_N)                           # N == BLOCK_N, no column tail mask\n\n      x_tile = load(X[rows, 0:N] -> alloc([SUB_M, BLOCK_N], [\"fast\", \"input_cache\"]))\n      w_tile = load(W[0:N]      -> alloc([BLOCK_N], [\"fast\", \"input_cache\"]))  # hoisted once per prog\n\n      # fp32 accumulation for numerical correctness\n      x32  = cast(x_tile, f32)\n      ss   = reduce_sum(x32 * x32, axis=1, alloc([SUB_M], [\"fastest\", \"accumulator\"]))\n      rrms = rsqrt(ss / N + eps)                       # [SUB_M], fp32\n\n      y32  = x32 * rrms[:, None] * cast(w_tile, f32)\n      store(cast(y32, f16) -> Y[rows, 0:N])\n}\n```\n\nDesign decisions:\n- **Op type**: fused reduce+elementwise (row-reduce then scale) — single kernel, single pass; x row is kept in UB so no re-load between reduce and normalize.\n- **Parallelization**: core-level over row blocks; secondary row split (SUB_M) per the mean-large case so grid lands on core count without tail blocks.\n- **Numerics**: mean-of-squares and rsqrt in fp32 (matches reference upcast), final store casts back to f16 — satisfies MERE/MARE fp16 gate.\n- **Weight reuse**: W loaded once per program into UB.\n- **No tail masks**: N=1024 is power-of-2 and ROWS_PER_PROG % SUB_M == 0; generic-N masking handled in codegen via constexpr guards.","tool_calls":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a48b3524bcf5cb51","type":"function","function":{"name":"TaskUpdate","arguments":"{\"status\":\"completed\",\"taskId\":\"2\"}"}},{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a20aaa7e6c7ade72","type":"function","function":{"name":"TaskUpdate","arguments":"{\"status\":\"in_progress\",\"taskId\":\"3\"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a48b3524bcf5cb51","content":"Updated task #2 status"},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a20aaa7e6c7ade72","content":"Updated task #3 status"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Now loading the coding references (fundamentals, examples, reduce) to generate the kernel per Triton-Ascend API constraints.","tool_calls":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8319f5020b7afa3d","type":"function","function":{"name":"Read","arguments":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/vince/.claude/plugins/cache/ascend-agent-skills/cannbot-triton-op-generator-skills/1.0.0/triton-op-coding/references/triton-ascend-fundamentals.md\"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8319f5020b7afa3d","content":"1\t# Triton Ascend 基础知识参考手册\n2\t\n3\t本文档汇集 Triton Ascend 编程的基础知识，包括 API 参考、编程模式、优化策略和调试技巧。\n4\t\n5\t---\n6\t\n7\t## 1. 编程基础\n8\t\n9\t### 1.1 核心概念\n10\t\n11\tTriton Ascend 采用与 Triton GPU 类似的执行模型：\n12\t\n13\t- **Kernel（内核）**：用 `@triton.jit` 装饰的函数，在 NPU 上并行执行\n14\t- **Grid（网格）**：启动的并行程序总数，由 `kernel[grid](args)` 指定\n15\t- **Block（块）**：每个程序处理的数据块，由 `tl.program_id(0)` 区分\n16\t\n17\t#### 内存层次\n18\t- **全局内存**: 主内存，所有程序可访问，延迟高\n19\t- **共享内存**: 块内共享，延迟低，容量有限\n20\t- **寄存器**: 每个线程私有，最快访问\n21\t\n22\t### 1.2 标准 Kernel 结构（五步模式）\n23\t\n24\t```python\n25\t@triton.jit\n26\tdef triton_better_kernel(in_ptr0, out_ptr0, xnumel, XBLOCK: tl.constexpr, XBLOCK_SUB: tl.constexpr):\n27\t    # Step 1: 计算当前核的起始偏移（核间切分）\n28\t    xoffset = tl.program_id(0) * XBLOCK\n29\t\n30\t    # Step 2: 核内循环（核内切分）\n31\t    for xoffset_sub in range(0, XBLOCK, XBLOCK_SUB):\n32\t        # Step 3: 构造数据索引\n33\t        x_index = xoffset + xoffset_sub + tl.arange(0, XBLOCK_SUB)[:]\n34\t\n35\t        # Step 4: 边界处理（mask）\n36\t        xmask = x_index < xnumel\n37\t\n38\t        # Step 5: 加载 → 计算 → 存储\n39\t        x = tl.load(in_ptr0 + x_index, xmask)\n40\t        ret = x * 0.5 * (1.0 + tl.erf(x / tl.sqrt(2.0)))\n41\t        tl.store(out_ptr0 + x_index, ret, xmask)\n42\t```\n43\t\n44\t### 1.3 内核启动方式\n45\t```python\n46\tdef launch_kernel(input_tensor, output_tensor):\n47\t    BLOCK_SIZE = 1024  \n48\t    grid = (triton.cdiv(input_tensor.numel(), BLOCK_SIZE),)\n49\t    \n50\t    kernel[grid](\n51\t        output_tensor, input_tensor, input_tensor.numel(),\n52\t        BLOCK_SIZE=BLOCK_SIZE,\n53\t    )\n54\t```\n55\t\n56\t### 1.4 边界处理（Mask）\n57\t\n58\t使用 mask 防止越界访问，确保只处理合法范围内的数据：\n59\t\n60\t```python\n61\txmask = x_index < xnumel\n62\tx = tl.load(in_ptr0 + x_index, mask=xmask, other=0.0)\n63\ttl.store(out_ptr0 + x_index, ret, mask=xmask)\n64\t```\n65\t\n66\t### 1.5 编程模式\n67\t\n68\t#### 1.5.1 向量操作模式\n69\t适用于元素级运算：加法、乘法、激活函数等。\n70\t\n71\t```python\n72\t@triton.jit\n73\tdef vector_add_kernel(a_ptr, b_ptr, c_ptr, n_elements, BLOCK_SIZE: tl.constexpr):\n74\t    pid = tl.program_id(0)\n75\t    offsets = pid * BLOCK_SIZE + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_SIZE)\n76\t    mask = offsets < n_elements\n77\t    \n78\t    a = tl.load(a_ptr + offsets, mask=mask)\n79\t    b = tl.load(b_ptr + offsets, mask=mask)\n80\t    c = a + b\n81\t    \n82\t    tl.store(c_ptr + offsets, c, mask=mask)\n83\t```\n84\t\n85\t#### 1.5.2 归约模式\n86\t适用于求和、最大值、最小值等聚合操作。\n87\t\n88\t```python\n89\t@triton.jit\n90\tdef reduction_kernel(input_ptr, output_ptr, n_elements, BLOCK_SIZE: tl.constexpr):\n91\t    pid = tl.program_id(0)\n92\t    offsets = pid * BLOCK_SIZE + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_SIZE)\n93\t    mask = offsets < n_elements\n94\t    \n95\t    # 加载数据\n96\t    data = tl.load(input_ptr + offsets, mask=mask, other=0.0)\n97\t    \n98\t    # 块内归约\n99\t    block_sum = tl.sum(data, axis=0)\n100\t    \n101\t    # 原子操作写回全局内存\n102\t    if pid == 0:  # 只有第一个块写入结果\n103\t        tl.atomic_add(output_ptr, block_sum)\n104\t```\n105\t\n106\t#### 1.5.3 矩阵乘法模式\n107\t使用块指针高效处理 2D 数据。\n108\t\n109\t```python\n110\t@triton.jit\n111\tdef matmul_kernel(a_ptr, b_ptr, c_ptr, M, N, K, stride_am, stride_ak, stride_bk, stride_bn, stride_cm, stride_cn, BLOCK_SIZE_M: tl.constexpr, BLOCK_SIZE_N: tl.constexpr, BLOCK_SIZE_K: tl.constexpr):\n112\t    # 获取程序 ID\n113\t    pid_m = tl.program_id(0)\n114\t    pid_n = tl.program_id(1)\n115\t    \n116\t    # 初始化累加器\n117\t    accumulator = tl.zeros((BLOCK_SIZE_M, BLOCK_SIZE_N), dtype=tl.float32)\n118\t    \n119\t    # 主循环：沿 K 轴迭代\n120\t    for k in range(0, K, BLOCK_SIZE_K):\n121\t        # 创建块指针\n122\t        a_block_ptr = tl.make_block_ptr(\n123\t            base=a_ptr, shape=(M, K), strides=(stride_am, stride_ak),\n124\t            offsets=(pid_m * BLOCK_SIZE_M, k), \n125\t            block_shape=(BLOCK_SIZE_M, BLOCK_SIZE_K), order=(1, 0)\n126\t        )\n127\t        b_block_ptr = tl.make_block_ptr(\n128\t            base=b_ptr, shape=(K, N), strides=(stride_bk, stride_bn),\n129\t            offsets=(k, pid_n * BLOCK_SIZE_N), \n130\t            block_shape=(BLOCK_SIZE_K, BLOCK_SIZE_N), order=(1, 0)\n131\t        )\n132\t        \n133\t        # 加载数据块\n134\t        a = tl.load(a_block_ptr, boundary_check=(0, 1))\n135\t        b = tl.load(b_block_ptr, boundary_check=(0, 1))\n136\t        \n137\t        # 矩阵乘加\n138\t        accumulator += tl.dot(a, b)\n139\t    \n140\t    # 存储结果\n141\t    c_block_ptr = tl.make_block_ptr(\n142\t        base=c_ptr, shape=(M, N), strides=(stride_cm, stride_cn),\n143\t        offsets=(pid_m * BLOCK_SIZE_M, pid_n * BLOCK_SIZE_N),\n144\t        block_shape=(BLOCK_SIZE_M, BLOCK_SIZE_N), order=(1, 0)\n145\t    )\n146\t    tl.store(c_block_ptr, accumulator, boundary_check=(0, 1))\n147\t```\n148\t\n149\t### 1.6 Autotune 使用\n150\t\n151\tTriton 支持 `autotune` 自动调优，但 **Ascend NPU 不支持 `num_warps`、`num_ctas`、`num_stages` 等 CUDA 专用调优参数**。在 Ascend 上主要调优：\n152\t\n153\t- `BLOCK_SIZE` / `XBLOCK` / `XBLOCK_SUB` 等分块参数\n154\t- `grid` 维度（核数）\n155\t\n156\t```python\n157\t@triton.autotune(\n158\t     configs=[\n159\t        triton.Config({'BLOCK_SIZE_M': 128, 'BLOCK_SIZE_N': 128, 'BLOCK_SIZE_K': 128}),\n160\t        triton.Config({'BLOCK_SIZE_M': 64, 'BLOCK_SIZE_N': 64, 'BLOCK_SIZE_K': 64}),\n161\t    ],\n162\t    key=['M', 'N', 'K'],  # 当这些参数变化时触发重新autotune\n163\t)\n164\t@triton.jit\n165\tddef matmul_kernel(\n166\t    a_ptr, b_ptr, c_ptr,\n167\t    M, N, K,\n168\t    stride_am, stride_ak, stride_bk, stride_bn, stride_cm, stride_cn,\n169\t    BLOCK_SIZE_M: tl.constexpr, # configs中的参数必须声明为constexpr\n170\t    BLOCK_SIZE_N: tl.constexpr, # configs中的参数必须声明为constexpr\n171\t    BLOCK_SIZE_K: tl.constexpr, # configs中的参数必须声明为constexpr\n172\t):\n173\t    # kernel实现\n174\t    pass\n175\t\n176\tclass ModelNew(torch.nn.Module):\n177\t    def __init__(self):\n178\t        super().__init__()\n179\t\n180\t    def forward(self, a, b):\n181\t    M, K = a.shape\n182\t    K, N = b.shape\n183\t    c = torch.empty((M, N), device=a.device, dtype=a.dtype)\n184\t    \n185\t    grid = lambda meta: (triton.cdiv(M, meta['BLOCK_SIZE_M']) * triton.cdiv(N, meta['BLOCK_SIZE_N']),) # grid设置是tuple\n186\t    \n187\t    # 关键：调用时不要传递configs中的参数（BLOCK_SIZE_M等）\n188\t    matmul_kernel[grid](\n189\t        a, b, c,\n190\t        M, N, K,\n191\t        a.stride(0), a.stride(1),\n192\t        b.stride(0), b.stride(1),\n193\t        c.stride(0), c.stride(1),\n194\t        # 不要写：BLOCK_SIZE_M=128  # 错误！autotune会自动传入\n195\t    )\n196\t    return c\n197\t```\n198\t---\n199\t\n200\t## 2. API 参考\n201\t\n202\t### 2.1 装饰器与启动\n203\t\n204\t| API | 说明 |\n205\t|-----|------|\n206\t| `@triton.jit` | 将 Python 函数编译为 Triton 内核 |\n207\t| `tl.program_id(axis)` | 当前程序在 grid 指定维度上的 ID |\n208\t| `tl.num_programs(axis)` | grid 在指定维度上的程序总数 |\n209\t| `triton.cdiv(x, y)` | 向上取整除法：`(x + y - 1) // y` |\n210\t\n211\t**@triton.jit 示例**：\n212\t```python\n213\t@triton.jit\n214\tdef kernel_function(...):\n215\t    pass\n216\t```\n217\t- **作用**: 将 Python 函数编译为硬件内核\n218\t- **约束**: 函数内部不能使用 `return`、`break`、`continue` 语句\n219\t\n220\t**tl.program_id(axis) 示例**：\n221\t```python\n222\tpid = tl.program_id(axis)  # axis: 0, 1, or 2\n223\t```\n224\t- **参数**: `axis` - 维度轴 (0, 1, 2)\n225\t- **返回**: 当前程序在该轴上的 ID\n226\t- **用途**: 确定当前程序块处理的数据范围\n227\t\n228\t**tl.num_programs(axis) 示例**：\n229\t```python\n230\tnum_pids = tl.num_programs(axis)  # axis: 0, 1, or 2\n231\t```\n232\t- **参数**: `axis` - 维度轴 (0, 1, 2)\n233\t- **返回**: 该轴上的总程序数\n234\t- **用途**: 计算网格大小和边界条件\n235\t\n236\t**triton.cdiv(a, b) 示例**：\n237\t```python\n238\tgrid_size = triton.cdiv(total_elements, block_size)\n239\t```\n240\t- **参数**: `a`, `b` - 被除数和除数\n241\t- **返回**: 向上取整的除法结果\n242\t- **用途**: host侧使用，计算启动网格大小\n243\t\n244\t### 2.2 内存访问\n245\t\n246\t| API | 说明 |\n247\t|-----|------|\n248\t| `tl.load(ptr, mask=None, other=0.0, boundary_check=None)` | 从全局内存加载数据 |\n249\t| `tl.store(ptr, value, mask=None, boundary_check=None)` | 将数据写入全局内存 |\n250\t| `tl.make_block_ptr(base, shape, strides, offsets, block_shape, order)` | 创建块指针，用于 2D/高维块访问 |\n251\t| `tl.advance(block_ptr, dim, delta)` | 沿指定维度推进块指针 |\n252\t\n253\t**tl.load 示例:**\n254\t```python\n255\tdata = tl.load(ptr + offsets, mask=mask, other=0.0)\n256\t```\n257\t- **参数**:\n258\t  - `pointer`: 内存指针\n259\t  - `mask`: 布尔掩码，True 表示有效位置\n260\t  - `other`: 掩码为 False 时的默认值\n261\t  - `boundary_check`: 边界检查维度 (0, 1) 或 None\n262\t- **返回**: 加载的张量数据\n263\t- **用途**: 从全局内存加载数据\n264\t\n265\t**tl.store 示例:**\n266\t```python\n267\ttl.store(ptr + offsets, result, mask=mask)\n268\t```\n269\t- **参数**:\n270\t  - `pointer`: 内存指针\n271\t  - `value`: 要存储的值\n272\t  - `mask`: 布尔掩码，True 表示有效位置\n273\t  - `boundary_check`: 边界检查维度 (0, 1) 或 None\n274\t- **用途**: 将数据存储到全局内存\n275\t\n276\t**tl.make_block_ptr 示例:**\n277\t```python\n278\tp_q = tl.make_block_ptr(\n279\t    base=q + (bos * HQ + i_hq) * K,\n280\t    shape=(T, K),\n281\t    strides=(HQ*K, 1),\n282\t    offsets=(i_t * BT, 0),\n283\t    block_shape=(BT, BK),\n284\t    order=(1, 0)\n285\t)\n286\tval = tl.load(p_q, boundary_check=(0, 1), padding=\"zero\")\n287\t```\n288\t- **参数**:\n289\t  - `base`: 基础内存指针\n290\t  - `shape`: 完整张量的形状\n291\t  - `strides`: 每个维度的步长\n292\t  - `offsets`: 当前块的起始偏移\n293\t  - `block_shape`: 当前块的大小\n294\t  - `order`: 内存布局顺序 (1, 0) 表示行主序\n295\t- **返回**: 块指针对象\n296\t- **用途**: 高效访问 2D 数据块\n297\t\n298\t**tl.advance 示例:**\n299\t```python\n300\tblock_ptr = tl.advance(block_ptr, (BLOCK_M, 0))\n301\t```\n302\t- **参数**:\n303\t  - `ptr`: 块指针\n304\t  - `offsets`: 各维度的偏移量\n305\t- **返回**: 移动后的块指针\n306\t- **用途**: 移动块指针到下一个位置\n307\t\n308\t### 2.3 张量构造与索引\n309\t\n310\t| API | 说明 |\n311\t|-----|------|\n312\t| `tl.arange(start, end)` | 创建一维索引张量 |\n313\t| `tl.zeros(shape, dtype)` | 创建全零张量 |\n314\t| `tl.full(shape, value, dtype)` | 创建填充指定值的张量 |\n315\t| `tl.cast(tensor, dtype)` | 类型转换 |\n316\t\n317\t**tl.arange 示例:**\n318\t```python\n319\toffsets = tl.arange(0, BLOCK_SIZE)\n320\t```\n321\t- **参数**: `start`, `end` - 起始和结束值\n322\t- **返回**: 连续整数序列\n323\t- **用途**: 创建索引序列\n324\t\n325\t**tl.zeros 示例:**\n326\t```python\n327\taccumulator = tl.zeros((BLOCK_M, BLOCK_N), dtype=tl.float32)\n328\t```\n329\t- **参数**:\n330\t  - `shape`: 张量形状\n331\t  - `dtype`: 数据类型\n332\t- **返回**: 全零张量\n333\t\n334\t**tl.full 示例:**\n335\t```python\n336\tones = tl.full((M, N), 1.0, dtype=tl.float32)\n337\t```\n338\t- **参数**:\n339\t  - `shape`: 张量形状\n340\t  - `value`: 填充值\n341\t  - `dtype`: 数据类型\n342\t- **返回**: 填充指定值的张量\n343\t\n344\t**tl.cast 示例:**\n345\t```python\n346\tfloat_data = tl.cast(int_data, tl.float32)\n347\t```\n348\t- **参数**:\n349\t  - `input`: 输入张量\n350\t  - `dtype`: 目标数据类型\n351\t- **返回**: 类型转换后的张量\n352\t\n353\t### 2.4 数学与归约\n354\t\n355\t| API | 说明 |\n356\t|-----|------|\n357\t| `tl.cdiv(a, b)` | 向上取整除法 |\n358\t| `tl.dot(a, b)` | 矩阵乘法 / 点积 |\n359\t| `tl.sum(tensor, axis)` | 沿轴求和 |\n360\t| `tl.max(tensor, axis)` | 沿轴求最大值 |\n361\t| `tl.where(condition, x, y)` | 条件选择 |\n362\t\n363\t**tl.cdiv 示例:**\n364\t```python\n365\tresult = tl.cdiv(offset, BLOCK_SIZE)\n366\t```\n367\t- **参数**: `a`, `b` - 被除数和除数\n368\t- **返回**: 向上取整的除法结果 ⌈a/b⌉\n369\t- **用途**: kernel内部使用，计算向上整除结果，等价于 `(a + b - 1) // b`\n370\t\n371\t**tl.dot 示例:**\n372\t```python\n373\tresult = tl.dot(a, b, acc=accumulator)\n374\t```\n375\t- **参数**:\n376\t  - `a`, `b`: 输入矩阵\n377\t  - `acc`: 累加器 (可选)\n378\t  - `allow_tf32`: 是否允许 TF32 精度\n379\t- **返回**: 矩阵乘法结果\n380\t- **用途**: 核心矩阵乘法操作\n381\t\n382\t**tl.sum 示例:**\n383\t```python\n384\tblock_sum = tl.sum(data, axis=0)\n385\t```\n386\t- **参数**:\n387\t  - `tensor`: 输入张量\n388\t  - `axis`: 归约轴\n389\t- **返回**: 归约结果\n390\t\n391\t**tl.max 示例:**\n392\t```python\n393\tmax_val = tl.max(data, axis=0)\n394\t```\n395\t- **参数**:\n396\t  - `tensor`: 输入张量\n397\t  - `axis`: 归约轴\n398\t- **返回**: 最大值\n399\t\n400\t**tl.where 示例:**\n401\t```python\n402\tresult = tl.where(mask, data, 0.0)\n403\t```\n404\t- **参数**:\n405\t  - `condition`: 条件张量\n406\t  - `x`, `y`: 选择值\n407\t- **返回**: 根据条件选择的值\n408\t- **用途**: SIMD 友好的条件选择\n409\t\n410\t### 2.5 扫描与原子操作\n411\t\n412\t| API | 说明 |\n413\t|-----|------|\n414\t| `tl.cumsum(tensor, axis)` | 沿轴累积和 |\n415\t| `tl.cumprod(tensor, axis)` | 沿轴累积积 |\n416\t| `tl.atomic_add(ptr, value)` | 原子加 |\n417\t| `tl.atomic_max(ptr, value)` | 原子最大值 |\n418\t\n419\t**tl.cumsum 示例:**\n420\t```python\n421\tcumulative_sum = tl.cumsum(data, axis=0)\n422\treverse_cumsum = tl.cumsum(data, axis=1, reverse=True)\n423\t```\n424\t- **参数**:\n425\t  - `tensor`: 输入张量\n426\t  - `axis`: 累积求和的轴 (默认为 0)\n427\t  - `reverse`: 是否反向累积 (默认为 False)\n428\t- **返回**: 累积求和结果张量\n429\t- **用途**: 计算沿指定轴的累积和，常用于前缀和计算\n430\t\n431\t**tl.cumprod 示例:**\n432\t```python\n433\tcumulative_prod = tl.cumprod(data, axis=0)\n434\treverse_cumprod = tl.cumprod(data, axis=1, reverse=True)\n435\t```\n436\t- **参数**:\n437\t  - `tensor`: 输入张量\n438\t  - `axis`: 累积乘积的轴 (默认为 0)\n439\t  - `reverse`: 是否反向累积 (默认为 False)\n440\t- **返回**: 累积乘积结果张量\n441\t- **用途**: 计算沿指定轴的累积乘积，常用于概率计算和序列处理\n442\t\n443\t**tl.atomic_add 示例:**\n444\t```python\n445\ttl.atomic_add(output_ptr, block_sum)\n446\t```\n447\t- **参数**:\n448\t  - `ptr`: 目标内存指针\n449\t  - `value`: 要添加的值\n450\t- **用途**: 线程安全的加法操作\n451\t\n452\t**tl.atomic_max 示例:**\n453\t```python\n454\ttl.atomic_max(max_ptr, local_max)\n455\t```\n456\t- **参数**:\n457\t  - `ptr`: 目标内存指针\n458\t  - `value`: 要比较的值\n459\t- **用途**: 线程安全的最大值更新\n460\t\n461\t### 2.6 编译时常量\n462\t\n463\t| API | 说明 |\n464\t|-----|------|\n465\t| `tl.constexpr` | 标记参数为编译时常量，用于 kernel 参数 |\n466\t\n467\t```python\n468\tdef kernel(ptr, n_elements, BLOCK_SIZE: tl.constexpr):\n469\t    ...\n470\tBLOCK_SIZE: tl.constexpr = 1024\n471\t```\n472\t- **用途**: 标记编译时常量参数\n473\t- **约束**: 必须在函数签名中声明\n474\t\n475\t### 2.7 布局与分块\n476\t\n477\t| API | 说明 |\n478\t|-----|------|\n479\t| `tl.swizzle2d(i, j, size_i, size_j, size_g)` | 2D 分块时的 swizzle 布局优化 |\n480\t\n481\t**tl.swizzle2d 示例:**\n482\t```python\n483\ttask_i, task_j = tl.swizzle2d(block_i, block_j, NUM_BLOCKS_I, NUM_BLOCKS_J, GROUP_SIZE)\n484\t```\n485\t- **参数**:\n486\t  - `i`, `j`: 原始块索引\n487\t  - `size_i`, `size_j`: 总块数\n488\t  - `size_g`: 分组大小(通常为2/4/8)\n489\t- **返回**: 重排后的块索引 (task_i, task_j)\n490\t- **用途**: 2D块重排,提升缓存局部性\n491\t- **适用场景**: 矩阵乘法等多维块计算,改善数据复用\n492\t- **注意**: 仅支持行优先(i方向)分组,列优先需手动实现\n493\t---\n494\t\n495\t## 3. Grid 配置策略\n496\t\n497\t### 3.1 Grid 维度限制\n498\t\n499\t- **Grid 必须是 tuple 类型**，最多 3 维\n500\t- **支持的格式**：`(x,)`, `(x, y)`, `(x, y, z)`\n501\t- **Grid 各维度最大值**：65535\n502\t- **BLOCK_SIZE 限制**：单块元素数 < 65536\n503\t\n504\t### 3.2 大 Shape 处理\n505\t\n506\t#### 问题描述\n507\t对于输入 shape 较大的算子，直接按照 `BLOCK_SIZE` 切分得到的 grid 总数可能超过 65535。\n508\t\n509\t**示例**：\n510\t- 输入 shape: `(327680, 1024)`\n511\t- BLOCK_SIZE: 1024\n512\t- Grid 需求: `327680 / 1024 = 320` (每行一个 block)\n513\t- 如果有多行：`327680 > 65535` 错误：超限！\n514\t\n515\t---\n516\t\n517\t当 `grid = (triton.cdiv(n, BLOCK_SIZE),)` 超过 65535 时，需采用以下策略之一。\n518\t\n519\t#### 方法一：交错循环（Interleaved Loop）\n520\t\n521\t#### 适用场景\n522\t- 按行/按块独立处理的算子\n523\t- Element-wise、Reduce、Normalization 等\n524\t\n525\t#### 核心思想\n526\t- **固定 Grid 为核心数**\n527\t- **每个核心以步长方式交错处理数据**\n528\t- **负载均衡最好，代码最简洁**\n529\t\n530\t每个核心循环处理多个块：\n531\t\n532\t```python\n533\t@triton.jit\n534\tdef kernel(ptr, n_elements, num_cores: tl.constexpr, BLOCK_SIZE: tl.constexpr):\n535\t    pid = tl.program_id(0)\n536\t    num_blocks = triton.cdiv(n_elements, BLOCK_SIZE)\n537\t\n538\t    for block_idx in range(pid, num_blocks, num_cores):\n539\t        offsets = block_idx * BLOCK_SIZE + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_SIZE)\n540\t        mask = offsets < n_elements\n541\t        data = tl.load(ptr + offsets, mask=mask, other=0.0)\n542\t        # compute...\n543\t        tl.store(ptr + offsets, result, mask=mask)\n544\t```\n545\t\n546\t#### 方法二：连续分块法（Continuous Block Method）\n547\t\n548\t##### 适用场景\n549\t- 连续内存访问优化\n550\t\n551\t将一维 grid 映射为多维，或使用 `(grid_x, grid_y)` 形式：\n552\t\n553\t```python\n554\tMAX_GRID = 65535\n555\tgrid_x = min(triton.cdiv(n, BLOCK_SIZE), MAX_GRID)\n556\tgrid_y = triton.cdiv(triton.cdiv(n, BLOCK_SIZE), MAX_GRID)\n557\tgrid = (grid_x, grid_y)\n558\t\n559\t# kernel 内: pid = tl.program_id(0) * grid_y + tl.program_id(1)\n560\t# 示例：处理大shape的向量操作\n561\t@triton.jit\n562\tdef large_vector_kernel(\n563\t    input_ptr, output_ptr, n_elements,\n564\t    BLOCK_SIZE: tl.constexpr,\n565\t    ELEMENTS_PER_GRID: tl.constexpr,  # 每个grid负责的元素总数\n566\t):\n567\t    pid = tl.program_id(0)\n568\t    \n569\t    # 计算当前grid负责的数据范围\n570\t    grid_start = pid * ELEMENTS_PER_GRID\n571\t    grid_end = min(grid_start + ELEMENTS_PER_GRID, n_elements)\n572\t    \n573\t    # 分块处理当前grid负责的数据\n574\t    for block_start in range(grid_start, grid_end, BLOCK_SIZE):\n575\t        offsets = block_start + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_SIZE)\n576\t        mask = offsets < grid_end\n577\t        \n578\t        # 加载、计算、存储\n579\t        data = tl.load(input_ptr + offsets, mask=mask)\n580\t        result = compute_function(data)\n581\t        tl.store(output_ptr + offsets, result, mask=mask)\n582\t\n583\t# 启动方式\n584\tclass ModelNew(torch.nn.Module):\n585\t    def __init__(self):\n586\t        super().__init__()\n587\t        # 在__init__中获取核心数\n588\t        try:\n589\t            self.VEC_CORE_NUM = torch_npu.npu.npu_config.get_device_limit(0).get(\"vector_core_num\", 40)\n590\t        except:\n591\t            self.VEC_CORE_NUM = 40\n592\t\n593\t    def forward(self, input_tensor):\n594\t        n_elements = input_tensor.numel()\n595\t        BLOCK_SIZE = *  # 设置为尽可能大的合适的每次处理的值，充分利用ub\n596\t        MAX_GRID_SIZE = self.VEC_CORE_NUM  # 使用初始化时获取的核心数\n597\t        \n598\t        # 计算每个grid需要处理的元素数\n599\t        ELEMENTS_PER_GRID = triton.cdiv(n_elements, MAX_GRID_SIZE)\n600\t        # 向上取整到BLOCK_SIZE的倍数，确保循环能完整处理\n601\t        ELEMENTS_PER_GRID = triton.cdiv(ELEMENTS_PER_GRID, BLOCK_SIZE) * BLOCK_SIZE\n602\t        \n603\t        # 计算实际需要的grid数量\n604\t        grid_size = triton.cdiv(n_elements, ELEMENTS_PER_GRID)\n605\t        \n606\t        output_tensor = torch.empty_like(input_tensor)\n607\t        large_vector_kernel[grid_size,](\n608\t            input_tensor, output_tensor, n_elements,\n609\t            BLOCK_SIZE=BLOCK_SIZE,\n610\t            ELEMENTS_PER_GRID=ELEMENTS_PER_GRID,\n611\t        )\n612\t        return output_tensor\n613\t```\n614\t\n615\t### 3.3 动态核心数获取\n616\t\n617\t根据算子类型选择核心类型：\n618\t\n619\t| 算子类型 | 核心类型 | 获取方式 |\n620\t|----------|----------|----------|\n621\t| Element-wise、Reduce | **VEC_CORE_NUM**（向量核心） | `torch_npu.npu.npu_config.get_device_limit(0).get(\"vector_core_num\", 40)` |\n622\t| MatMul | **CUBE_CORE_NUM**（矩阵核心） | `torch_npu.npu.npu_config.get_device_limit(0).get(\"cube_core_num\", 20)` |\n623\t\n624\t**关键规则**：必须在 `__init__` 中获取核心数，**不能在 `forward` 中获取**，否则每次前向都会查询，影响性能。\n625\t\n626\t```python\n627\timport torch_npu\n628\t\n629\tclass ModelNew(torch.nn.Module):\n630\t    def __init__(self):\n631\t        super().__init__()\n632\t        try:\n633\t            self.VEC_CORE_NUM = torch_npu.npu.npu_config.get_device_limit(0).get(\"vector_core_num\", 40)\n634\t            self.CUBE_CORE_NUM = torch_npu.npu.npu_config.get_device_limit(0).get(\"cube_core_num\", 20)\n635\t        except Exception:\n636\t            self.VEC_CORE_NUM = 40\n637\t            self.CUBE_CORE_NUM = 20\n638\t\n639\t    def forward(self, x):\n640\t        grid = (self.VEC_CORE_NUM,)\n641\t        kernel[grid](...)\n642\t```\n643\t\n644\t#### 重要注意事项\n645\t\n646\t**禁止在 forward 中调用 `get_device_limit`**\n647\t\n648\t```python\n649\t# 错误：错误：每次 forward 都调用，触发设备同步\n650\tclass ModelNew(torch.nn.Module):\n651\t    def forward(self, input_tensor):\n652\t        core_num = torch_npu.npu.npu_config.get_device_limit(0).get(\"vector_core_num\", 48)\n653\t        grid = (core_num,)\n654\t        ...\n655\t\n656\t# 正确：正确：在 __init__ 中调用，只执行一次\n657\tclass ModelNew(torch.nn.Module):\n658\t    def __init__(self):\n659\t        super().__init__()\n660\t        self.VEC_CORE_NUM = torch_npu.npu.npu_config.get_device_limit(0).get(\"vector_core_num\", 48)\n661\t    \n662\t    def forward(self, input_tensor):\n663\t        grid = (self.VEC_CORE_NUM,)\n664\t        ...\n665\t```\n666\t\n667\t**原因**：`torch_npu` 的 import 和 `get_device_limit` 调用会触发设备同步，在 forward 中频繁调用会严重影响性能。\n668\t\n669\t---\n670\t\n671\t## 4. 内存访问优化\n672\t\n673\t### 4.1 Block Size 选择\n674\t\n675\t| 算子类型 | 推荐 BLOCK_SIZE | 说明 |\n676\t|----------|-----------------|------|\n677\t| Element-wise | 1024–2048 | 平衡并行度与资源占用 |\n678\t| Reduce | 256 / 128 | 归约需要更多寄存器 |\n679\t| MatMul | M=128, K=256, N=256（或 128/128/32） | 满足 512B 行宽对齐 |\n680\t\n681\t### 4.2 访问优化\n682\t- **2D数据**: 优先使用 `tl.make_block_ptr` 配合 `boundary_check`，自动优化内存合并\n683\t- **步幅设计**: 仔细设计stride参数，错误设置会严重影响性能\n684\t- **数据布局**: 保持内存访问的连续性和局部性\n685\t\n686\t### 4.3 2D 数据访问：tl.make_block_ptr\n687\t\n688\t对于 2D 张量，使用 `tl.make_block_ptr` 可简化索引并提升访存效率：\n689\t\n690\t```python\n691\t# 2D 块访问示例\n692\tptr = tl.make_block_ptr(\n693\t    base=a_ptr,\n694\t    shape=(M, K),\n695\t    strides=(K, 1),\n696\t    offsets=(block_m * BLOCK_M, 0),\n697\t    block_shape=(BLOCK_M, BLOCK_K),\n698\t    order=(1, 0)\n699\t)\n700\ta = tl.load(ptr, boundary_check=(0, 1), padding=\"zero\")\n701\t```\n702\t\n703\t### 4.4 1D 连续内存优化\n704\t\n705\t**优先使用 `.contiguous()` + 1D 访问**，避免 stride 访问带来的额外开销：\n706\t\n707\t```python\n708\tclass ModelNew(torch.nn.Module):\n709\t    def forward(self, input_tensor):\n710\t        if not input_tensor.is_contiguous():\n711\t            input_tensor = input_tensor.contiguous()\n712\t\n713\t        output_tensor = torch.empty_like(input_tensor)\n714\t        n_elements = input_tensor.numel()\n715\t        grid = (triton.cdiv(n_elements, BLOCK_SIZE),)\n716\t        elementwise_kernel[grid](input_tensor, output_tensor, n_elements, BLOCK_SIZE)\n717\t        return output_tensor\n718\t\n719\t@triton.jit\n720\tdef elementwise_kernel(input_ptr, output_ptr, n_elements, BLOCK_SIZE: tl.constexpr):\n721\t    pid = tl.program_id(0)\n722\t    offsets = pid * BLOCK_SIZE + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_SIZE)\n723\t    mask = offsets < n_elements\n724\t    data = tl.load(input_ptr + offsets, mask=mask)\n725\t    result = compute(data)\n726\t    tl.store(output_ptr + offsets, result, mask=mask)\n727\t```\n728\t\n729\t### 4.4 对齐规则\n730\t\n731\t- **256B**：基础对齐单位\n732\t- **512B**：MatMul 等带宽敏感算子推荐（256 个 fp16/bf16 元素）\n733\t\n734\t---\n735\t\n736\t## 5. 性能优化\n737\t\n738\t### 5.1 1D Grid 优先\n739\t\n740\t优先使用一维 grid `(n,)`，便于与 Ascend 核心映射一致。\n741\t\n742\t### 5.2 核内循环优化\n743\t\n744\t编译器会对核内 `for` 循环做自动流水线优化，实现存算并行：\n745\t\n746\t```python\n747\t@triton.jit\n748\tdef optimized_elementwise(input_ptr, output_ptr, n_elements, BLOCK_SIZE: tl.constexpr):\n749\t    pid = tl.program_id(0)\n750\t\n751\t    for i in range(4):\n752\t        offsets = (pid * 4 + i) * BLOCK_SIZE + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_SIZE)\n753\t        mask = offsets < n_elements\n754\t        data = tl.load(input_ptr + offsets, mask=mask)\n755\t        result = compute(data)\n756\t        tl.store(output_ptr + offsets, result, mask=mask)\n757\t```\n758\t\n759\t### 5.3 算子拆分策略\n760\t\n761\t复杂算子可拆分为多个 kernel，减少单 kernel 复杂度，便于调优。\n762\t\n763\t### 5.4 NPU 核心配置\n764\t\n765\t- Element-wise / Reduce：使用 VEC 核心，`grid=(VEC_CORE_NUM,)`\n766\t- MatMul：使用 CUBE 核心，`grid=(CUBE_CORE_NUM,)`\n767\t\n768\t### 5.5 数据传输单位\n769\t\n770\tAscend NPU 数据传输以 **256B** 为单位，设计 block 大小时需考虑对齐。\n771\t\n772\t### 5.6 数值稳定性\n773\t\n774\t- **Softmax 防溢出**：先减最大值再 `exp`\n775\t- **sqrt 非负检查**：`tl.maximum(variance, 0.0)` 再开方\n776\t- **累加用 float32**：reduce 累加建议用 `tl.float32` 避免精度损失\n777\t\n778\t```python\n779\t# 错误：直接 exp 可能溢出\n780\tscores = tl.exp(x)\n781\t\n782\t# 正确：减去最大值\n783\tmax_val = tl.max(x, axis=0)\n784\tscores = tl.exp(x - max_val)\n785\t\n786\t# 方差开方前确保非负\n787\tvariance = tl.maximum(variance, 0.0)\n788\trstd = 1.0 / tl.sqrt(variance + eps)\n789\t```\n790\t\n791\t### 5.7 API 限制（Ascend 特有）\n792\t\n793\t#### 禁止使用的语法\n794\t- 禁止 `return`, `break`, `continue` → 使用mask控制\n795\t- 禁止 lambda表达式 → 使用内联函数或tl.where\n796\t- 禁止 链式布尔运算 → 分步计算mask\n797\t- 禁止 张量直接索引 → 使用tl.load/tl.store\n798\t\n799\t#### tl.constexpr 正确用法\n800\t- **仅在内核参数中使用**: `BLOCK_SIZE: tl.constexpr`\n801\t- **不可在host侧使用**: 启动函数中不可用tl.constexpr\n802\t\n803\t| 限制 | 说明 |\n804\t|------|------|\n805\t| 无 return/break/continue | 使用变量和条件控制流程 |\n806\t| 无 lambda | 使用普通函数或内联逻辑 |\n807\t| 无 while 循环 | 用 `for` + `if` 替代 |\n808\t| 无 Python 切片 | 用 `tl.get_element` / `tl.extract_slice` / `tl.insert_slice` |\n809\t| constexpr 仅用于 kernel 参数 | 编译时常量通过参数传入 |\n810\t| 避免 tl.where 做内存偏移 | 易导致低效，改用 boundary_check 或 mask |\n811\t| 标量类型转换 | 用 `.to(tl.float32)` 等，不用 `tl.float16()` |\n812\t\n813\t```python\n814\t# 不推荐：tl.where 用于偏移\n815\t# ptr = base + tl.where(mask, idx, 0)\n816\t\n817\t# 推荐：mask 用于 load/store\n818\tdata = tl.load(ptr + idx, mask=mask, other=0.0)\n819\t```\n820\t\n821\t---\n822\t\n823\t## 6. 调试清单\n824\t\n825\t### 6.1 内存访问清单\n826\t\n827\t- [ ] 所有 load/store 是否有正确的 mask 或 boundary_check\n828\t- [ ] 指针偏移是否可能越界\n829\t- [ ] 是否使用 `.contiguous()` 保证连续访问\n830\t- [ ] Block 大小是否满足 256B/512B 对齐\n831\t\n832\t### 6.2 控制流清单\n833\t\n834\t- [ ] 是否使用了 `return` / `break` / `continue`（Ascend 不支持）\n835\t- [ ] 是否使用了 `while`（需改为 `for` + `if`）\n836\t- [ ] 是否使用了 lambda\n837\t- [ ] 是否使用了 Python 切片（需改为 tl 切片 API）\n838\t\n839\t### 6.3 Grid/Block 清单\n840\t\n841\t- [ ] Grid 各维度是否 ≤ 65535\n842\t- [ ] BLOCK_SIZE 是否 < 65536\n843\t- [ ] 大 shape 是否采用交错循环或连续块法\n844\t- [ ] 核心数是否在 `__init__` 中获取\n845\t\n846\t### 6.4 并发清单\n847\t\n848\t- [ ] 多 kernel 调用时中间张量是否正确传递\n849\t- [ ] 原子操作是否正确使用（如有）\n850\t\n851\t### 6.5 切片清单\n852\t\n853\t- [ ] 多维索引是否正确计算\n854\t- [ ] 是否使用 `tl.extract_slice` / `tl.insert_slice` 替代 Python 切片\n855\t\n856\t### 6.6 性能清单\n857\t\n858\t- [ ] 是否优先 1D grid\n859\t- [ ] Element-wise 是否使用 VEC 核心\n860\t- [ ] MatMul 是否使用 CUBE 核心\n861\t- [ ] 是否利用核内循环实现存算并行\n862\t\n863\t### 6.7 常见错误速查表\n864\t\n865\t| 错误现象 | 可能原因 | 排查方向 |\n866\t|----------|----------|----------|\n867\t| 编译失败：unsupported op | 使用了 Ascend 不支持的 API | 检查 return/break/while/lambda/切片 |\n868\t| 数值不一致 | 精度、reduce 维度、边界处理 | 检查 mask、axis、float32 累加 |\n869\t| 越界 / 崩溃 | 指针或索引计算错误 | 检查 offset 公式、mask 覆盖 |\n870\t| Grid 超限 | grid 维度 > 65535 | 使用交错循环或拆分 grid |\n871\t| 性能差 | 访存不连续、block 过小 | 使用 contiguous、调整 BLOCK_SIZE |\n872\t| tl.where 相关错误 | Ascend 上 tl.where 用于偏移易出问题 | 改用 mask + other 或 boundary_check |\n873\t\n874\t### 6.8 常见错误解决表\n875\t\n876\t| 错误类型 | 典型症状 | 常见原因 | 解决方案 |\n877\t|---------|---------|---------|---------|\n878\t| 内存越界访问 | 运行时错误、结果异常、随机崩溃 | load/store缺少mask或boundary_check | 添加正确的mask或boundary_check保护 |\n879\t| Grid超限 | 编译失败或运行时错误 | grid总大小超过65535 | 使用交错循环`for i in range(pid, total, core_num)`或连续分块处理 |\n880\t| 控制流错误 | 编译失败、语法错误 | 使用了return/break/continue | 移除禁用语句，使用mask控制流程 |\n881\t| while循环错误 | 编译失败（Ascend后端） | 使用了while循环 | 改用for + if替代：`for i in range(MAX): if i < n:` |\n882\t| 切片语法错误 | 编译失败 | 使用了`b[0]`或`b[i:j]`直接切片 | 使用`tl.get_element`或`tl.extract_slice` |\n883\t| tl.arange索引错误 | 编译失败 | 对`tl.arange`结果使用`get_element` | 直接计算索引值而非提取 |\n884\t| 类型转换错误 | 编译警告或错误 | 使用`tl.float16(scalar)`转换 | 改用`scalar.to(tl.float16)` |\n885\t| constexpr误用 | 编译失败 | 在host侧使用tl.constexpr | 仅在kernel参数中使用tl.constexpr |\n886\t| Stride设置错误 | 计算结果错误、数据错位 | stride参数计算或传递错误 | 验证stride设置，检查tensor.stride() |\n887\t| 数值不稳定 | 结果为NaN或Inf | softmax/sqrt等操作溢出 | 减去最大值、检查非负、使用float32 |\n888\t| 数据竞争 | 结果不确定、每次运行不同 | 多program并发写入同一位置 | 使用tl.atomic_add等原子操作 |\n889\t| BLOCK_SIZE过大 | 编译失败或运行时错误 | BLOCK_SIZE超过65536或硬件限制 | 减小BLOCK_SIZE，使用循环处理 |\n890\t| tl.where偏移计算 | 编译失败（Ascend后端） | 在内存偏移中使用tl.where | 改用if-else静态分支处理 |\n891\t| 性能低下 | 运行缓慢 | 内存访问不连续、切分不合理 | 优化内存布局、调整BLOCK_SIZE、使用block_ptr |\n892\t\n893\t---\n894\t\n895\t## 注意conv类卷积算子编写：\n896\ttorch module中的卷积算子生成会包含一个随机权重weight，为保证我们生成的triton实现也具有相同的结果，我们可以在triton的host侧代码中生成对应的weight，例如：\n897\t```python\n898\timport torch\n899\timport torch.nn as nn\n900\timport triton\n901\timport triton.language as tl\n902\t\n903\t@triton.jit\n904\tdef triton_kernel():\n905\t    pass\n906\tdef triton_host():\n907\t    args = ...\n908\t    weight = nn.conv(**args).weight.to(device)\n909\t```\n910\t具体的参数和''nn''中调用的module要与torch保持一致，device与传入的backend保持一致（如\"npu\"），我会在调用triton之前固定相同的随机种子，所以在这里只需要正确地创建类的实例，并导出权重\n911\t\n912\t---\n913\t\n914\t## 附录：完整代码示例\n915\t\n916\t### A.1 Vector Add（向量加法）\n917\t\n918\t```python\n919\t@triton.jit\n920\tdef vector_add_kernel(a_ptr, b_ptr, c_ptr, n_elements, BLOCK_SIZE: tl.constexpr):\n921\t    pid = tl.program_id(0)\n922\t    offsets = pid * BLOCK_SIZE + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_SIZE)\n923\t    mask = offsets < n_elements\n924\t\n925\t    a = tl.load(a_ptr + offsets, mask=mask)\n926\t    b = tl.load(b_ptr + offsets, mask=mask)\n927\t    c = a + b\n928\t\n929\t    tl.store(c_ptr + offsets, c, mask=mask)\n930\t\n931\tclass ModelNew(torch.nn.Module):\n932\t    def forward(self, a, b):\n933\t        c = torch.empty_like(a)\n934\t        n_elements = a.numel()\n935\t        grid = (triton.cdiv(n_elements, BLOCK_SIZE),)\n936\t        vector_add_kernel[grid](a, b, c, n_elements, BLOCK_SIZE=1024)\n937\t        return c\n938\t```\n939\t\n940\t### A.2 Reduce 算子（块内归约 + 原子操作）\n941\t\n942\t```python\n943\t@triton.jit\n944\tdef reduction_kernel(input_ptr, output_ptr, n_elements, BLOCK_SIZE: tl.constexpr):\n945\t    pid = tl.program_id(0)\n946\t    offsets = pid * BLOCK_SIZE + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_SIZE)\n947\t    mask = offsets < n_elements\n948\t\n949\t    data = tl.load(input_ptr + offsets, mask=mask, other=0.0)\n950\t    block_sum = tl.sum(data, axis=0)\n951\t    tl.atomic_add(output_ptr, block_sum)\n952\t```\n953\t\n954\t### A.3 MatMul（固定核心数启动）\n955\t\n956\t```python\n957\t@triton.jit\n958\tdef matmul_kernel(\n959\t    a_ptr, b_ptr, c_ptr,\n960\t    M, N, K,\n961\t    num_cores: tl.constexpr,\n962\t    BLOCK_M: tl.constexpr,\n963\t    BLOCK_N: tl.constexpr,\n964\t    BLOCK_K: tl.constexpr,\n965\t):\n966\t    pid = tl.program_id(0)\n967\t    NUM_BLOCKS_M = triton.cdiv(M, BLOCK_M)\n968\t    NUM_BLOCKS_N = triton.cdiv(N, BLOCK_N)\n969\t    NUM_BLOCKS = NUM_BLOCKS_M * NUM_BLOCKS_N\n970\t\n971\t    for block_idx in range(pid, NUM_BLOCKS, num_cores):\n972\t        block_m = block_idx // NUM_BLOCKS_N\n973\t        block_n = block_idx % NUM_BLOCKS_N\n974\t\n975\t        accumulator = tl.zeros((BLOCK_M, BLOCK_N), dtype=tl.float32)\n976\t\n977\t        for k in range(0, K, BLOCK_K):\n978\t            a_offset = (block_m * BLOCK_M + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_M))[:, None] * K + \\\n979\t                       (k + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_K))[None, :]\n980\t            a_mask = (block_m * BLOCK_M + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_M))[:, None] < M\n981\t            a = tl.load(a_ptr + a_offset, mask=a_mask, other=0.0)\n982\t\n983\t            b_offset = (k + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_K))[:, None] * N + \\\n984\t                       (block_n * BLOCK_N + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_N))[None, :]\n985\t            b_mask = (block_n * BLOCK_N + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_N))[None, :] < N\n986\t            b = tl.load(b_ptr + b_offset, mask=b_mask, other=0.0)\n987\t\n988\t            accumulator += tl.dot(a, b)\n989\t\n990\t        c_offset = (block_m * BLOCK_M + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_M))[:, None] * N + \\\n991\t                   (block_n * BLOCK_N + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_N))[None, :]\n992\t        c_mask = ((block_m * BLOCK_M + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_M))[:, None] < M) & \\\n993\t                 ((block_n * BLOCK_N + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_N))[None, :] < N)\n994\t        tl.store(c_ptr + c_offset, accumulator, mask=c_mask)\n995\t\n996\tclass ModelNew(torch.nn.Module):\n997\t    def __init__(self):\n998\t        super().__init__()\n999\t\n1000\t    def forward(self, a, b):\n1001\t        M, K = a.shape\n1002\t        K2, N = b.shape\n1003\t        assert K == K2\n1004\t        c = torch.empty((M, N), device=a.device, dtype=a.dtype)\n1005\t\n1006\t        num_cores = 20\n1007\t        BLOCK_M, BLOCK_N, BLOCK_K = 128, 256, 256\n1008\t\n1009\t        matmul_kernel[(num_cores,)](a, b, c, M, N, K, num_cores,\n1010\t                                    BLOCK_M, BLOCK_N, BLOCK_K)\n1011\t        return c\n1012\t```\n1013\t\n1014\t### A.4 LayerNorm 核心逻辑（归一化）\n1015\t\n1016\t```python\n1017\t# 1. 计算均值\n1018\tmean = tl.sum(x, axis=0) / n_cols\n1019\t\n1020\t# 2. 计算方差\n1021\tx_centered = x - mean\n1022\tvariance = tl.sum(x_centered * x_centered, axis=0) / n_cols\n1023\t\n1024\t# 3. 归一化\n1025\tvariance = tl.maximum(variance, 0.0)\n1026\trstd = 1.0 / tl.sqrt(variance + eps)\n1027\tnormalized = x_centered * rstd\n1028\t\n1029\t# 4. 应用 weight 和 bias\n1030\toutput = normalized * weight + bias\n1031\t```\n1032\t\n1033\t### A.5 Double Kernel（多内核调用）\n1034\t\n1035\t```python\n1036\tclass ModelNew(torch.nn.Module):\n1037\t    def forward(self, x):\n1038\t        intermediate = torch.empty_like(x)\n1039\t        kernel1[grid](x, intermediate, ...)\n1040\t\n1041\t        output = torch.empty_like(x)\n1042\t        kernel2[grid](intermediate, output, ...)\n1043\t\n1044\t        return output\n1045\t```\n1046\t\n1047\t### A.6 完整 GELU 示例\n1048\t\n1049\t```python\n1050\timport triton\n1051\timport triton.language as tl\n1052\timport torch\n1053\t\n1054\t@triton.jit\n1055\tdef triton_easy_kernel(in_ptr0, out_ptr0, NUMEL: tl.constexpr):\n1056\t    idx_block = tl.arange(0, NUMEL)\n1057\t    x = tl.load(in_ptr0 + idx_block)\n1058\t    ret = x * 0.5 * (1.0 + tl.erf(x / tl.sqrt(2.0)))\n1059\t    tl.store(out_ptr0 + idx_block, ret)\n1060\t\n1061\t@triton.jit\n1062\tdef triton_better_kernel(in_ptr0, out_ptr0, xnumel, XBLOCK: tl.constexpr, XBLOCK_SUB: tl.constexpr):\n1063\t    xoffset = tl.program_id(0) * XBLOCK\n1064\t    for xoffset_sub in range(0, XBLOCK, XBLOCK_SUB):\n1065\t        x_index = xoffset + xoffset_sub + tl.arange(0, XBLOCK_SUB)[:]\n1066\t        xmask = x_index < xnumel\n1067\t        x = tl.load(in_ptr0 + x_index, xmask)\n1068\t        ret = x * 0.5 * (1.0 + tl.erf(x / tl.sqrt(2.0)))\n1069\t        tl.store(out_ptr0 + x_index, ret, xmask)\n1070\t\n1071\t# 调用示例\n1072\tncore = 32\n1073\txblock = 32768\n1074\txblock_sub = 8192\n1075\ttriton_better_kernel[ncore, 1, 1](x0, out1, x0.numel(), xblock, xblock_sub)\n1076\t```\n1077\t\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}],"tools":[{"type":"function","function":{"name":"Agent","description":"Agent","parameters":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"object","properties":{"description":{"type":"string","description":"A short (3-5 word) description of the task"},"prompt":{"type":"string","description":"The task for the agent to perform"},"subagent_type":{"description":"The type of specialized agent to use for this task","type":"string"},"model":{"description":"Optional model override for this agent. Takes precedence over the agent definition's model frontmatter. If omitted, uses the agent definition's model, or inherits from the parent.","type":"string","enum":["small","premium","fast"]},"run_in_background":{"description":"Set to true to run this agent in the background. You will be notified when it completes.","type":"boolean"},"name":{"description":"Name for the spawned agent. Makes it addressable via SendMessage({to: name}) while running.","type":"string"},"team_name":{"description":"Team name for spawning. Uses current team context if omitted.","type":"string"}},"required":["description","prompt"],"additionalProperties":false}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"AscendSkillSourceCheck","description":"AscendSkillSourceCheck","parameters":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"object","properties":{"source":{"type":"string","enum":["agent-skills","ms-agent-skills"]},"action":{"type":"string","enum":["check","update"]},"timeoutMs":{"type":"integer","exclusiveMinimum":0,"maximum":120000}},"required":["source","action"],"additionalProperties":false}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"AskUserQuestion","description":"AskUserQuestion","parameters":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"object","properties":{"questions":{"minItems":1,"maxItems":4,"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"question":{"type":"string","description":"The complete question to ask the user. Should be clear, specific, and end with a question mark. Example: \"Which library should we use for date formatting?\" If multiSelect is true, phrase it accordingly, e.g. \"Which features do you want to enable?\""},"header":{"type":"string","description":"Very short label displayed as a chip/tag (max 12 chars). Examples: \"Auth method\", \"Library\", \"Approach\"."},"options":{"minItems":2,"maxItems":4,"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"label":{"type":"string","description":"The display text for this option that the user will see and select. Should be concise (1-5 words) and clearly describe the choice."},"description":{"type":"string","description":"Explanation of what this option means or what will happen if chosen. Useful for providing context about trade-offs or implications."},"preview":{"description":"Optional preview content rendered when this option is focused. Use for mockups, code snippets, or visual comparisons that help users compare options. See the tool description for the expected content format.","type":"string"}},"required":["label","description"],"additionalProperties":false},"description":"The available choices for this question. Must have 2-4 options. Each option should be a distinct, mutually exclusive choice (unless multiSelect is enabled). There should be no 'Other' option, that will be provided automatically."},"multiSelect":{"default":false,"description":"Set to true to allow the user to select multiple options instead of just one. Use when choices are not mutually exclusive.","type":"boolean"}},"required":["question","header","options","multiSelect"],"additionalProperties":false},"description":"Questions to ask the user (1-4 questions)"},"answers":{"description":"User answers collected by the permission component","type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{"type":"string"}},"annotations":{"description":"Optional per-question annotations from the user (e.g., notes on preview selections). Keyed by question text.","type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{"type":"object","properties":{"preview":{"description":"The preview content of the selected option, if the question used previews.","type":"string"},"notes":{"description":"Free-text notes the user added to their selection.","type":"string"}},"additionalProperties":false}},"metadata":{"description":"Optional metadata for tracking and analytics purposes. Not displayed to user.","type":"object","properties":{"source":{"description":"Optional identifier for the source of this question (e.g., \"remember\" for /remember command). Used for analytics tracking.","type":"string"}},"additionalProperties":false}},"required":["questions"],"additionalProperties":false}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"Bash","description":"Bash","parameters":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"object","properties":{"command":{"type":"string","description":"The bash command to execute."},"description":{"description":"Clear, concise description of what this command does (shown in the UI).","type":"string"},"timeout_ms":{"description":"Timeout in milliseconds. The executor applies its configured default and cap, and kills the command on expiry.","type":"integer","exclusiveMinimum":0,"maximum":9007199254740991},"timeout":{"description":"Timeout in milliseconds (alias accepted by the shared tool-execution layer).","type":"integer","exclusiveMinimum":0,"maximum":9007199254740991},"_simulatedSedEdit":{"type":"object","properties":{"filePath":{"type":"string"},"before":{"type":"string"},"after":{"type":"string"}},"required":["filePath"],"additionalProperties":false},"run_in_background":{"description":"Run in the background and return a task id immediately (collect with TaskOutput, stop with TaskStop).","type":"boolean"},"dangerouslyDisableSandbox":{"description":"Run the command outside the sandbox (use only when sandbox restrictions caused the failure).","type":"boolean"}},"required":["command"],"additionalProperties":false}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"Config","description":"Config","parameters":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"object","properties":{"setting":{"type":"string","description":"The setting key (e.g., \"theme\", \"model\", \"permissions.defaultMode\")"},"value":{"description":"The new value. Omit to get current value.","type":["string","boolean","number"]}},"required":["setting"],"additionalProperties":false}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"Edit","description":"Edit","parameters":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"object","properties":{"file_path":{"type":"string","description":"The absolute path to the file to modify"},"old_string":{"type":"string","description":"The text to replace"},"new_string":{"type":"string","description":"The text to replace it with (must be different from old_string)"},"replace_all":{"description":"Replace all occurrences of old_string (default false)","default":false,"type":"boolean"}},"required":["file_path","old_string","new_string"],"additionalProperties":false}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"EnterPlanMode","description":"EnterPlanMode","parameters":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"object","properties":{},"additionalProperties":false}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"EnterWorktree","description":"EnterWorktree","parameters":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"object","properties":{"name":{"description":"Optional name for the worktree. Each \"/\"-separated segment may contain only letters, digits, dots, underscores, and dashes; max 64 chars total. A random name is generated if not provided.","type":"string"}},"additionalProperties":false}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"ExitPlanMode","description":"ExitPlanMode","parameters":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"object","properties":{"allowedPrompts":{"description":"Prompt-based permissions needed to implement the plan. These describe categories of actions rather than specific commands.","type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"tool":{"type":"string","enum":["Bash"],"description":"The tool this prompt applies to"},"prompt":{"type":"string","description":"Semantic description of the action, e.g. \"run tests\", \"install dependencies\""}},"required":["tool","prompt"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"additionalProperties":{}}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"ExitWorktree","description":"ExitWorktree","parameters":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"object","properties":{"action":{"type":"string","enum":["keep","remove"],"description":"\"keep\" leaves the worktree and branch on disk; \"remove\" deletes both."},"discard_changes":{"description":"Required true when action is \"remove\" and the worktree has uncommitted files or unmerged commits. The tool will refuse and list them otherwise.","type":"boolean"}},"required":["action"],"additionalProperties":false}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"Glob","description":"Glob","parameters":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"object","properties":{"pattern":{"type":"string","description":"The glob pattern to match files against"},"path":{"description":"The directory to search in. If not specified, the current working directory will be used. IMPORTANT: Omit this field to use the default directory. DO NOT enter \"undefined\" or \"null\" - simply omit it for the default behavior. Must be a valid directory path if provided.","type":"string"}},"required":["pattern"],"additionalProperties":false}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"Grep","description":"Grep","parameters":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"object","properties":{"pattern":{"type":"string","description":"The regular expression pattern to search for in file contents"},"path":{"description":"File or directory to search in (rg PATH). Defaults to current working directory.","type":"string"},"glob":{"description":"Glob pattern to filter files (e.g. \"*.js\", \"*.{ts,tsx}\") - maps to rg --glob","type":"string"},"output_mode":{"description":"Output mode: \"content\" shows matching lines (supports -A/-B/-C context, -n line numbers, head_limit), \"files_with_matches\" shows file paths (supports head_limit), \"count\" shows match counts (supports head_limit). Defaults to \"files_with_matches\".","type":"string","enum":["content","files_with_matches","count"]},"-B":{"description":"Number of lines to show before each match (rg -B). Requires output_mode: \"content\", ignored otherwise.","type":"number"},"-A":{"description":"Number of lines to show after each match (rg -A). Requires output_mode: \"content\", ignored otherwise.","type":"number"},"-C":{"description":"Alias for context.","type":"number"},"context":{"description":"Number of lines to show before and after each match (rg -C). Requires output_mode: \"content\", ignored otherwise.","type":"number"},"-n":{"description":"Show line numbers in output (rg -n). Requires output_mode: \"content\", ignored otherwise. Defaults to true.","type":"boolean"},"-i":{"description":"Case insensitive search (rg -i)","type":"boolean"},"type":{"description":"File type to search (rg --type). Common types: js, py, rust, go, java, etc. More efficient than include for standard file types.","type":"string"},"head_limit":{"description":"Limit output to first N lines/entries, equivalent to \"| head -N\". Works across all output modes: content (limits output lines), files_with_matches (limits file paths), count (limits count entries). Defaults to 250 when unspecified. Pass 0 for unlimited (use sparingly — large result sets waste context).","type":"number"},"offset":{"description":"Skip first N lines/entries before applying head_limit, equivalent to \"| tail -n +N | head -N\". Works across all output modes. Defaults to 0.","type":"number"},"multiline":{"description":"Enable multiline mode where . matches newlines and patterns can span lines (rg -U --multiline-dotall). Default: false.","type":"boolean"}},"required":["pattern"],"additionalProperties":false}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"ListMcpResourcesTool","description":"ListMcpResourcesTool","parameters":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"object","properties":{"server":{"description":"Optional server name to filter resources by","type":"string"}},"additionalProperties":false}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"NotebookEdit","description":"NotebookEdit","parameters":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"object","properties":{"notebook_path":{"type":"string","description":"The absolute path to the Jupyter notebook file to edit (must be absolute, not relative)"},"cell_id":{"description":"The ID of the cell to edit. When inserting a new cell, the new cell will be inserted after the cell with this ID, or at the beginning if not specified.","type":"string"},"new_source":{"type":"string","description":"The new source for the cell"},"cell_type":{"description":"The type of the cell (code or markdown). If not specified, it defaults to the current cell type. If using edit_mode=insert, this is required.","type":"string","enum":["code","markdown"]},"edit_mode":{"description":"The type of edit to make (replace, insert, delete). Defaults to replace.","type":"string","enum":["replace","insert","delete"]}},"required":["notebook_path","new_source"],"additionalProperties":false}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"Read","description":"Read","parameters":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"object","properties":{"file_path":{"type":"string","description":"The absolute path to the file to read"},"offset":{"description":"The line number to start reading from. Only provide if the file is too large to read at once","type":"integer","minimum":0,"maximum":9007199254740991},"limit":{"description":"The number of lines to read. Only provide if the file is too large to read at once.","type":"integer","exclusiveMinimum":0,"maximum":9007199254740991},"pages":{"description":"Page range for PDF files (e.g., \"1-5\", \"3\", \"10-20\"). Only applicable to PDF files. Maximum 20 pages per request.","type":"string"},"allow_large":{"description":"Set to true only when you explicitly need the entire plain text file in one read and still have context space for it. This lifts the size and output-token limits for that full plain text read; providing offset and limit still selects the range, and the normal limits then apply to it. It does not affect images, PDFs, or notebooks.","type":"boolean"}},"required":["file_path"],"additionalProperties":false}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"ReadMcpResourceTool","description":"ReadMcpResourceTool","parameters":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"object","properties":{"server":{"type":"string","description":"The MCP server name"},"uri":{"type":"string","description":"The resource URI to read"}},"required":["server","uri"],"additionalProperties":false}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"Skill","description":"Skill","parameters":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"object","properties":{"skill":{"type":"string","description":"The skill name. E.g., \"commit\", \"review-pr\", or \"pdf\""},"args":{"description":"Optional arguments for the skill","type":"string"}},"required":["skill"],"additionalProperties":false}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"TaskCreate","description":"TaskCreate","parameters":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"object","properties":{"subject":{"type":"string","description":"A brief title for the task"},"description":{"type":"string","description":"What needs to be done"},"activeForm":{"description":"Present continuous form shown in spinner when in_progress (e.g., \"Running tests\")","type":"string"},"metadata":{"description":"Arbitrary metadata to attach to the task","type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["subject","description"],"additionalProperties":false}}},{"type":"function","function":